# Final Audit — x86_emit.oo post-fixes (5-shape gate, fall-through, typed shim, chain trim)

Logline: One-shot read-only audit of ooda/oodac/x86_emit.oo confirming the 209-line shape, the 4-element header, the 22-arm chain, the 5-shape refuse gate, the silent fall-through fix, and the Tier 5 #24 Turn 1 typed-AST shim land cleanly with no dead imports.

Setup: Sources are ooda/oodac/x86_emit.oo (209 lines, target), openOODA/STATUS_v2.oot (67 lines, post-fix floor snapshot), audit/x86-final.oot (69 lines, in-flight projection), and ooda/oodac/* (29 sibling import targets). No compiler run. No file edits. No /tmp writes.

Beats:
  1. Recap each verification item with the expected, actual, and file:line evidence.
  2. List any issues found (numbered, ranked by impact).
  3. State the final verdict with one line of reasoning.

residual: Re-run the 6,936-fixture probe to convert central estimates into measured numbers (openOODA/STATUS_v2.oot:25, audit/x86-final.oot §2 Item 7).

File: openOODA/audit/x86_emit_post_fixes_final.oot
Status: smoke — read-only final audit, 2026-08-25
Scope: x86_emit.oo only; AArch64 and SSA live in their own audits

